<title>ITALY: Italy's IRI to repay 8 trln lire of loans.</title>
<headline>Italy's IRI to repay 8 trln lire of loans.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian state holding company IRI said in a statement it would repay eight trillion lire of loans using money from the Italian Treasury received from the purchase of IRI's majority stake in STET.</p>
<p>The Italian Treasury agreed last year to buy IRI's stake in telecoms holding company STET in the first move towards merging STET with Telecom Italia and then fully privatising the merged group.</p>
</text>
